      "writtenOn": "2023-05-17T18:31:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I thought the relevant system state was that the USB 2.0 hub hadn\u0027t enumerated. The EC doesn\u0027t have knowledge of that.\n\nI don\u0027t know whether this will work yet, but if we do need to land a quirk, I\u0027d rather do it where we have more memory.",
